  ('c76d76c1-e1a8-5734-8c5d-837b6e26b499', 'bf8ff2c4-cc07-508b-a181-5636f282720b', 'In right triangle $JKL$, the tangent of $\angle L$ is $\frac{3}{4}$. What is the length of $JK$?', '["$1635$", "$415$", "$21$", "$28$"]'::jsonb, 12, '![figure](/q/oct25/002.webp)'),
  ('733eb42e-0763-52b5-b83f-ba739ffa793a', 'bf8ff2c4-cc07-508b-a181-5636f282720b', 'What is the minimum value of the given function? $f(x) = x^{2} - 12x + 12$', '["$-24$", "$-12$", "$6$", "$12$"]'::jsonb, 13, null),
  ('5dcdcf59-1475-5955-83f8-1d68b4a19b27', 'bf8ff2c4-cc07-508b-a181-5636f282720b', 'For the linear function $g$, $g(9) = 11$ and $g(x + 1) - g(x) = 2$. Which equation defines $g$?', '["$g(x) = 9x + 2$", "$g(x) = 9x + 11$", "$g(x) = 2x - 18$", "$g(x) = 2x - 7$"]'::jsonb, 14, null),
  ('d04e8be3-e823-5e00-a3fd-db1d0dc78876', 'bf8ff2c4-cc07-508b-a181-5636f282720b', '', '[]'::jsonb, 15, 'For the linear function $f$, the table shows three values of $x$ and their corresponding values of $f(x)$. Function $f$ is defined by $f(x) = rx + s$, where $r$ and $s$ are constants. What is the value of $rs$?

